{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Omelet You Cook</strong> is a  cozy chaotic roguelike where your cooking skills are put to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/a220c76fb9ea436fb3c9a5d2c1a2bc45.poster.avif?t=1773219658\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/a220c76fb9ea436fb3c9a5d2c1a2bc45.webm?t=1773219658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/a220c76fb9ea436fb3c9a5d2c1a2bc45.mp4?t=1773219658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the perfect omelet by combining ingredients to meet the demands of quirky customers. Each round brings new hazards, restrictions, and ever-increasing score thresholds that will push your culinary creativity to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/8ae1b9ea4dbe77707344b3a2e5ce3894.poster.avif?t=1773219658\" width=900 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/8ae1b9ea4dbe77707344b3a2e5ce3894.webm?t=1773219658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Every customer has a distinct personality and unique tastes, so you\u2019ll need to stay versatile and adjust your recipes on the fly. One minute you're crafting a classic bell pepper and bacon omelet, and the next you're tossing in donuts, pickles and pineapple. Keep your cool and keep those omelets coming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/e09f8f5696938603ffe748cfa5daf427.avif?t=1773219658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras_big/e09f8f5696938603ffe748cfa5daf427.avif?t=1773219658 width=800 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Omelet You Cook is created by two indie devs and draws inspiration from beloved arcade roguelikes like <i>Balatro</i>, <i>Luck Be a Landlord</i>, and <i>Ballionaire</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature List:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc14 70+ customers that shake up every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd53 140+ delicious (and sometimes ridiculous) ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc2 90+ synergy-enabling helpers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc0 A shop to expand your culinary arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd51 Unlockable ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f 5 difficulties to progress through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd57 13 pantries with different starting ingredient combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/8214371f31c2bd4376878478d86795fb.avif?t=1773219658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras_big/8214371f31c2bd4376878478d86795fb.avif?t=1773219658 width=800 height=147 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to become an overworked cafeteria worker? Alright then; <strong>Omelet You Cook</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/a49e9eb8949e3a28239f12788ac43ad3.avif?t=1773219658\" width=1474 height=2150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Green Apron Certified","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3205380/127b0dd292c1dfe60484f624d494bf79238c62ee.jpg"},{"name":"Yellow Apron Certified","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3205380/32dcd3f1f19a110160c4ef91a807f9fcfb9b5f5d.jpg"},{"name":"Blue Apron Certified","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3205380/2ce3456c76f3aec6d60ce6cc2b6bfaa5df93557b.jpg"},{"name":"Red Apron Certified","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3205380/50c4a2776b4b9d3e2b28eb4edad2b7f81136d58b.jpg"},{"name":"The Star Ingredient","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3205380/189fad650de465079022754bc96e3c50d575e270.jpg"},{"name":"The Signature Ingredient","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3205380/c56541dc4d7e76836686a551dc00be3ece2d3fd3.jpg"},{"name":"Trust Me, You've Gotta Try It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3205380/7b54a433fdb2e16063eae2f5119f4b631233a4e5.jpg"},{"name":"That Hot Heat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3205380/b0ecf304fdb425887b3d24ddfd09404a21220bac.jpg"},{"name":"Everything but the Kitchen Sink","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3205380/57071d456c58f9409076994713e5b8126e1ae4c6.jpg"},{"name":"Omelet You Cook","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3205380/f949d4c9d631af52073b396dec9c47051a746ee7.jpg"}],"total":99},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3205380?t=1773219658","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/e41032d6fa87a82072a23120ca133e5b9255078b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773219658","ca