r-increasing score thresholds that will push your culinary creativity to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/8ae1b9ea4dbe77707344b3a2e5ce3894.poster.avif?t=1773219658\" width=900 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/8ae1b9ea4dbe77707344b3a2e5ce3894.webm?t=1773219658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Every customer has a distinct personality and unique tastes, so you\u2019ll need to stay versatile and adjust your recipes on the fly. One minute you're crafting a classic bell pepper and bacon omelet, and the next you're tossing in donuts, pickles and pineapple. Keep your cool and keep those omelets coming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/e09f8f5696938603ffe748cfa5daf427.avif?t=1773219658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras_big/e09f8f5696938603ffe748cfa5daf427.avif?t=1773219658 width=800 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Omelet You Cook is created by two indie devs and draws inspiration from beloved arcade roguelikes like <i>Balatro</i>, <i>Luck Be a Landlord</i>, and <i>Ballionaire</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature List:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc14 70+ customers that shake up every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd53 140+ delicious (and sometimes ridiculous) ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc2 90+ synergy-enabling helpers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc0 A shop to expand your culinary arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd51 Unlockable ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f 5 difficulties to progress through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd57 13 pantries with different starting ingredient combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/8214371f31c2bd4376878478d86795fb.avif?t=1773219658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras_big/8214371f31c2bd4376878478d86795fb.avif?t=1773219658 width=800 height=147 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to become an overworked cafeteria worker? Alright then; <strong>Omelet You Cook</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/a49e9eb8949e3a28239f12788ac43ad3.avif?t=1773219658\" width=1474 height=2150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Dan Schumacher","Hjalte Tagmose"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/2fd7db5555800ff5bd8f687c9dd06e591212ee7c/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1773219658","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3205380/1436788025/886ff4dab071a6149fe39fdd0912750cce44fb2e/1770574455/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770575275","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3205380/1436788025/886ff4dab071a6149fe39fdd0912750cce44fb2e/1770574455/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770575275","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3205380/1436788025/886ff4dab071a6149fe39fdd0912750cce44fb2e/1770574455/hls_264_master.m3u